@startuml 答题捕获客户端用况图
' 冉昕霖 · 第二阶段分析 · 客户端用况图
' 表达玩家目标，不把按钮画成用况；恢复未决结果也由玩家主动发起
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam arrowColor #5B6B7C
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #B9C7D4
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
left to right direction

actor "玩家" as Player

rectangle "PKMon 客户端 · 答题捕获与精灵收录" {
  usecase "UC-R1\n进入答题并取得题目" as R1
  usecase "UC-R2\n提交作答并查看结果" as R2
  usecase "UC-R3\n答错后重试" as R3
  usecase "UC-R4\n恢复结果待确认" as R4
  usecase "UC-R5\n查看收藏概览" as R5
}

Player --> R1
Player --> R2
Player --> R3
Player --> R4
Player --> R5

R3 ..> R2 : 仅 WRONG 且挑战仍 OPEN
R4 ..> R2 : 超时/断网后改用状态查询

note bottom of R5
  支撑系统：捕获服务提供题目与结算，SessionStore 提供身份。
  客户端不持有正确答案，也不依据本地状态发放精灵；
  是否捕获以服务端结算结果为准。
end note
@enduml
